あいつになりたくてもがいても
Even if you struggle wanting to become like them,

587
00:40:20,693 --> 00:40:23,693
底なし沼のように沈んでくよ
You'll just sink like in a bottomless swamp.

588
00:40:24,093 --> 00:40:28,893
