597
00:40:51,793 --> 00:40:54,093
他は騙せないオリジナルを奏でないと
You can't fool others unless you play something original,

598
00:40:54,293 --> 00:40:56,893
過去の自分に足を引っ張られて退場
Dragged down by your past self and forced off the stage.

599
00:40:57,093 --> 00:40:59,293
俺とお前との差は遺伝子レベル
The difference between you and me is on a genetic level.

600
00:40:59,593 --> 00:41:01,893
俺を狂わせた父祖父母には感謝してる
I'm grateful to my parents and grandparents who drove me crazy,

601
00:41:02,093 --> 00:41:04,593
さらに磨き上げた自分自身にも感謝してる
And I'm grateful to myself for honing it even further.

602
00:41:04,793 --> 00:41:07,893
なのになんかしてる君 差が離れてくうちに
Yet you're doing whatever you do, and as the gap widens,

603
