あれもカスでこれもカスで俺の歌詞で振り向かす
That's trash, this is trash, I'll turn heads with my lyrics.

618
00:41:55,293 --> 00:41:57,893
ムキになって無視してた知らぬうちに街を換う
Getting defensive and ignoring it, prowling through the town unnoticed.

619
