思想すらも曲がってる だけど顔は笑ってる
Even your mindset is twisted, but your face keeps smiling.

623
00:42:08,593 --> 00:42:11,193
嘘だらけの肥溜めで のぼせるまで浸かって
Soaking in a cesspool of lies until you're dizzy,

624
00:42:11,393 --> 00:42:13,893
空に祈り捧げたって 変えられるのは声だけ
Praying to the sky, but the only thing you can change is your voice.

625
00:42:14,093 --> 00:42:16,593
何かあれば孤独気取り むしり取るかね
Pretending to be lonely whenever something happens, snatching up money.

626
00:42:16,793 --> 00:42:19,393
指で擦りめくり 表あれば裏探すだけ
Rubbing and flipping with fingers, if there's a front, just looking for the back.

627
00:42:19,593 --> 00:42:22,193
歯止め効かぬ無駄な愚痴も 全て愛で砕けて
Unstoppable useless complaints, all shattered by love,

